        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report describes the development and testing of a computer tool to capture design, construction, and operations knowledge and apply it in the coordination of mechanical and electrical systems for buildings. It includes a description of the current practice for this coordination, using light tables, along with the knowledge framework and reasoning structure for the tool.",
